Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(2d): no entry advice for an Adaptive op on its ring
 fallback

Refs #3748

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket.rs       | 6 +++++-
 crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket_avoid.rs | 5 ++++-
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket.rs b/crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket.rs
index 712abf2f5..c7964f67e 100644
--- a/crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket.rs
